Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,560] | Elapsed:  17.35s | Words: 8  | Text: 大部分的男人都是坏种
Segment #2   [00:00:01,560 --> 00:00:04,080] | Elapsed:  17.35s | Words: 16 | Text: 如果说我把那些男人的这些坏心思告诉你
Segment #3   [00:00:04,080 --> 00:00:05,980] | Elapsed:  17.35s | Words: 9  | Text: 你的世界观有可能瞬间崩塌
Segment #4   [00:00:05,980 --> 00:00:08,200] | Elapsed:  17.35s | Words: 12 | Text: 就是有些真相对你越早知道越好
Segment #5   [00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:11,500] | Elapsed:  17.35s | Words: 17 | Text: 千万不要被一些坏男人玩了以后才过来后悔
Segment #6   [00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:14,140] | Elapsed:  17.35s | Words: 11 | Text: 今天这个视频你一定要压着你的恶心
Segment #7   [00:00:14,140 --> 00:00:15,340] | Elapsed:  17.35s | Words: 5  | Text: 内心的看完
Segment #8   [00:00:15,340 --> 00:00:17,340] | Elapsed:  17.35s | Words: 12 | Text: 你现在越无知 未来你就会越倒霉
Segment #9   [00:00:17,340 --> 00:00:17,980] | Elapsed:  17.35s | Words: 3  | Text: 首先第一点
Segment #10  [00:00:17,980 --> 00:00:20,380] | Elapsed:  17.35s | Words: 13 | Text: 男人的欲望是越远达越感情的
Segment #11  [00:00:20,380 --> 00:00:22,700] | Elapsed:  17.35s | Words: 14 | Text: 因为男人的天性他就是我先爽的再说
Segment #12  [00:00:22,700 --> 00:00:24,320] | Elapsed:  17.35s | Words: 6  | Text: 所有男人都是这样的
Segment #13  [00:00:24,320 --> 00:00:26,000] | Elapsed:  17.35s | Words: 10 | Text: 当一个男人他来到你的身边
Segment #14  [00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:27,800] | Elapsed:  17.35s | Words: 7  | Text: 当他唯一的目的
Segment #15  [00:00:27,800 --> 00:00:29,200] | Elapsed:  38.86s | Words: 6  | Text: 不是说就是我要娶你
Segment #16  [00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:30,240] | Elapsed:  38.86s | Words: 7  | Text: 我要先把你当老婆
Segment #17  [00:00:30,240 --> 00:00:31,600] | Elapsed:  38.86s | Words: 6  | Text: 而是我要先输亡
Segment #18  [00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:33,340] | Elapsed:  38.86s | Words: 10 | Text: 我得先抵记我闯完再说
Segment #19  [00:00:33,340 --> 00:00:35,060] | Elapsed:  38.86s | Words: 10 | Text: 就这么黑暗 这是男人的天性
Segment #20  [00:00:35,060 --> 00:00:37,520] | Elapsed:  38.86s | Words: 12 | Text: 所有的你所谓的一见一见钟情
Segment #21  [00:00:37,520 --> 00:00:39,020] | Elapsed:  38.86s | Words: 8  | Text: 它其实它是尖色起义
Segment #22  [00:00:39,020 --> 00:00:41,560] | Elapsed:  38.86s | Words: 9  | Text: 所以说大家一定要去找男人的时候
Segment #23  [00:00:41,560 --> 00:00:43,020] | Elapsed:  38.86s | Words: 6  | Text: 一定要涂点什么东西
Segment #24  [00:00:43,020 --> 00:00:45,280] | Elapsed:  38.86s | Words: 7  | Text: 可以是钱 可以是资源
Segment #25  [00:00:45,280 --> 00:00:46,380] | Elapsed:  38.86s | Words: 4  | Text: 可以是认知
Segment #26  [00:00:46,380 --> 00:00:48,440] | Elapsed:  38.86s | Words: 7  | Text: 但是唯独不能是感情
Segment #27  [00:00:48,440 --> 00:00:49,560] | Elapsed:  38.86s | Words: 7  | Text: 绝对不可以是爱情
Segment #28  [00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:52,200] | Elapsed:  38.86s | Words: 14 | Text: 你应该去找那些能够帮自己的未来
Segment #29  [00:00:52,200 --> 00:00:53,480] | Elapsed:  38.86s | Words: 8  | Text: 提供一些帮助的东西
Segment #30  [00:00:53,480 --> 00:00:55,060] | Elapsed:  38.86s | Words: 6  | Text: 如果你们没有这个思维
Segment #31  [00:00:55,060 --> 00:00:57,320] | Elapsed:  38.86s | Words: 14 | Text: 你一定会被你们身边的男人吃干嘛净
Segment #32  [00:00:57,320 --> 00:00:58,620] | Elapsed:  62.27s | Words: 3  | Text: 第二点就是
Segment #33  [00:00:58,980 --> 00:01:01,260] | Elapsed:  62.27s | Words: 13 | Text: 不要对任何一个男人有过高的期待
Segment #34  [00:01:01,260 --> 00:01:02,360] | Elapsed:  62.27s | Words: 6  | Text: 因为刚才我讲了
Segment #35  [00:01:02,360 --> 00:01:04,060] | Elapsed:  62.27s | Words: 11 | Text: 我们男人看在骨子里的基因
Segment #36  [00:01:04,060 --> 00:01:05,080] | Elapsed:  62.27s | Words: 6  | Text: 就是为了意识爽
Segment #37  [00:01:05,080 --> 00:01:05,960] | Elapsed:  62.27s | Words: 6  | Text: 他为了得到你
Segment #38  [00:01:05,960 --> 00:01:07,340] | Elapsed:  62.27s | Words: 10 | Text: 他能给你去的天花乱坠
Segment #39  [00:01:07,340 --> 00:01:09,120] | Elapsed:  62.27s | Words: 10 | Text: 但是真正你被他得到之后
Segment #40  [00:01:09,120 --> 00:01:11,480] | Elapsed:  62.27s | Words: 13 | Text: 最终等待你的结果就是无限的失望
Segment #41  [00:01:11,480 --> 00:01:13,360] | Elapsed:  62.27s | Words: 8  | Text: 而每一个对你好的男人
Segment #42  [00:01:13,360 --> 00:01:14,640] | Elapsed:  62.27s | Words: 8  | Text: 其实他都是带有目的的
Segment #43  [00:01:14,640 --> 00:01:15,780] | Elapsed:  62.27s | Words: 7  | Text: 你不要叫他是来救你的
Segment #44  [00:01:15,780 --> 00:01:18,100] | Elapsed:  62.27s | Words: 8  | Text: 你要知道真正愿意养你
Segment #45  [00:01:18,100 --> 00:01:19,120] | Elapsed:  62.27s | Words: 7  | Text: 不求回复我的男人
Segment #46  [00:01:19,120 --> 00:01:20,220] | Elapsed:  62.27s | Words: 7  | Text: 他除了你爹以外
Segment #47  [00:01:20,220 --> 00:01:21,640] | Elapsed:  62.27s | Words: 7  | Text: 在这个生活上基本上没有
Segment #48  [00:01:21,640 --> 00:01:25,040] | Elapsed:  62.27s | Words: 18 | Text: 价值交换才是任何关系中永恒不厌的定律
Segment #49  [00:01:25,040 --> 00:01:26,040] | Elapsed:  62.27s | Words: 5  | Text: 就算你再漂亮
Segment #50  [00:01:26,040 --> 00:01:27,940] | Elapsed:  87.16s | Words: 12 | Text: 但你没有能力也没有任何的价值
Segment #51  [00:01:27,940 --> 00:01:29,640] | Elapsed:  87.16s | Words: 9  | Text: 等待你的结果就三个字
Segment #52  [00:01:29,640 --> 00:01:30,620] | Elapsed:  87.16s | Words: 3  | Text: 被抛弃
Segment #53  [00:01:30,620 --> 00:01:31,680] | Elapsed:  87.16s | Words: 4  | Text: 那第三点就是
Segment #54  [00:01:31,680 --> 00:01:33,660] | Elapsed:  87.16s | Words: 10 | Text: 如果说一个男人能够持续的
Segment #55  [00:01:33,660 --> 00:01:34,540] | Elapsed:  87.16s | Words: 5  | Text: 对一个女人好
Segment #56  [00:01:34,540 --> 00:01:35,160] | Elapsed:  87.16s | Words: 3  | Text: 只有一个原因
Segment #57  [00:01:35,160 --> 00:01:36,940] | Elapsed:  87.17s | Words: 8  | Text: 就是这个女人能够持续
Segment #58  [00:01:36,940 --> 00:01:39,440] | Elapsed:  87.17s | Words: 11 | Text: 不断的去反捕男人一些东西
Segment #59  [00:01:39,440 --> 00:01:40,200] | Elapsed:  87.17s | Words: 4  | Text: 他想要的
Segment #60  [00:01:40,200 --> 00:01:41,640] | Elapsed:  87.17s | Words: 9  | Text: 比如说有可能是情绪价值
Segment #61  [00:01:41,640 --> 00:01:42,760] | Elapsed:  87.17s | Words: 5  | Text: 有可能是资源
Segment #62  [00:01:42,760 --> 00:01:44,700] | Elapsed:  87.17s | Words: 11 | Text: 有可能是任何可以交换的东西
Segment #63  [00:01:44,700 --> 00:01:46,320] | Elapsed:  87.17s | Words: 8  | Text: 但是一定要存在价值交换
Segment #64  [00:01:46,320 --> 00:01:48,160] | Elapsed:  87.17s | Words: 8  | Text: 而且还是这个男人所需要的
Segment #65  [00:01:48,160 --> 00:01:49,200] | Elapsed:  87.17s | Words: 5  | Text: 你们千万不要觉得
Segment #66  [00:01:49,200 --> 00:01:51,100] | Elapsed:  87.17s | Words: 11 | Text: 某些对你们好的男人是个傻子
Segment #67  [00:01:51,460 --> 00:01:52,320] | Elapsed:  87.17s | Words: 4  | Text: 你就记住了
Segment #68  [00:01:52,320 --> 00:01:54,080] | Elapsed:  87.17s | Words: 6  | Text: 比你有钱的男人
Segment #69  [00:01:54,080 --> 00:01:55,000] | Elapsed:  87.17s | Words: 5  | Text: 一定不比你傻
Segment #70  [00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:56,280] | Elapsed: 108.21s | Words: 9  | Text: 我就我经常讲的一句话
Segment #71  [00:01:56,280 --> 00:01:57,660] | Elapsed: 108.21s | Words: 6  | Text: 我说一段关系
Segment #72  [00:01:57,660 --> 00:02:00,180] | Elapsed: 108.21s | Words: 10 | Text: 他能够长久的能威慑下去
Segment #73  [00:02:00,180 --> 00:02:01,760] | Elapsed: 108.21s | Words: 9  | Text: 一定是基于双方的价值
Segment #74  [00:02:01,760 --> 00:02:02,780] | Elapsed: 108.21s | Words: 6  | Text: 在不断的增长
Segment #75  [00:02:02,780 --> 00:02:04,680] | Elapsed: 108.21s | Words: 9  | Text: 如果说双方差距过大的话
Segment #76  [00:02:04,680 --> 00:02:05,820] | Elapsed: 108.21s | Words: 7  | Text: 这两人一定会败的
Segment #77  [00:02:05,820 --> 00:02:07,000] | Elapsed: 108.21s | Words: 5  | Text: 因为在这个世界上
Segment #78  [00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:07,780] | Elapsed: 108.21s | Words: 5  | Text: 任何人爱你
Segment #79  [00:02:07,780 --> 00:02:09,500] | Elapsed: 108.21s | Words: 10 | Text: 任何人对你都是有条件的
Segment #80  [00:02:09,500 --> 00:02:11,160] | Elapsed: 108.21s | Words: 7  | Text: 你的父母能对你们好
Segment #81  [00:02:11,160 --> 00:02:13,740] | Elapsed: 108.21s | Words: 12 | Text: 是因为我觉得我把我小孩儿养大了
Segment #82  [00:02:13,740 --> 00:02:15,280] | Elapsed: 108.21s | Words: 9  | Text: 他就可能后期能够养老
Segment #83  [00:02:15,280 --> 00:02:16,320] | Elapsed: 108.21s | Words: 4  | Text: 就这么现实
Segment #84  [00:02:16,320 --> 00:02:17,520] | Elapsed: 108.21s | Words: 5  | Text: 所以说一个女人
Segment #85  [00:02:17,520 --> 00:02:19,360] | Elapsed: 108.21s | Words: 12 | Text: 想要在感情上立于不外之地
Segment #86  [00:02:19,360 --> 00:02:20,600] | Elapsed: 108.21s | Words: 5  | Text: 你一定要学会什么
Segment #87  [00:02:21,080 --> 00:02:23,140] | Elapsed: 108.21s | Words: 12 | Text: 学会在人性的角度去看待问题
Segment #88  [00:02:23,140 --> 00:02:24,920] | Elapsed: 122.16s | Words: 7  | Text: 你不要做那个恋爱脑
Segment #89  [00:02:24,920 --> 00:02:26,260] | Elapsed: 122.16s | Words: 6  | Text: 帮你能够看明白
Segment #90  [00:02:26,260 --> 00:02:27,560] | Elapsed: 122.16s | Words: 7  | Text: 他所做的每一件事情
Segment #91  [00:02:27,560 --> 00:02:29,480] | Elapsed: 122.16s | Words: 10 | Text: 和他背后的每一个目的的时候
Segment #92  [00:02:29,480 --> 00:02:31,660] | Elapsed: 122.16s | Words: 13 | Text: 你才能真正地不被男人所欺负
Segment #93  [00:02:31,660 --> 00:02:32,360] | Elapsed: 122.16s | Words: 4  | Text: 加油 孟生人
Segment #94  [00:02:32,360 --> 00:02:33,300] | Elapsed: 122.16s | Words: 6  | Text: 祝你们越来越好
Segment #95  [00:02:33,300 --> 00:02:34,680] | Elapsed: 122.16s | Words: 8  | Text: 千万不要做一个傻女人
Segment #96  [00:02:34,680 --> 00:02:37,380] | Elapsed: 122.16s | Words: 10 | Text: 我不许允许我的任何女粉丝
Segment #97  [00:02:37,380 --> 00:02:38,900] | Elapsed: 122.16s | Words: 8  | Text: 在感情里吃任何亏
Segment #98  [00:02:38,900 --> 00:02:39,560] | Elapsed: 122.16s | Words: 1  | Text: 加油
